[gd_scene format=3]

; The Quench, under the Slag's coolant pool (map offset (169.5, -196.5)): the reservoir where the foundry cooled what it cast.
; A hatch in its roof drains the pool above; under it a drop into deep, still coolant among sunken quench tanks. Sinking
; (Ballast) leads to the drain in its floor, falling on into the Crucible; floating up from the drain, the pilgrim rides the
; surface to the ledges on the west wall and climbs back up to the hatch (the way home from the Crucible, needing nothing).

